OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 30 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including a
OL,8,     Gperformance of Tchaikovsky's
OL,9,     GManfred Symphony from the BBC
OL,10,     GSymphony Orchestra.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,12,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod pursues Franz
OL,14,     GXaver Mozart as he returns to
OL,15,     GVienna, a period when his health
OL,16,     Gbegan to rapidly decline.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc with live music from Leon
OL,19,     GMcCawley and Tom Ollendorff and
OL,20,     Ghis band.
